  "title_zh": "习近平出席金砖国家领导人第十八次会晤第一阶段会议并发表重要讲话",
  "title_en": "Xi Jinping Attends First Session of 18th BRICS Leaders' Meeting and Delivers Important Speech",
  "summary_zh": "当地时间9月12日下午，国家主席习近平在新德里出席金砖国家领导人第十八次会晤第一阶段会议，并发表题为《共担时代责任 勇做先锋力量》的重要讲话。",
  "summary_en": "On the afternoon of September 12 local time, President Xi Jinping attended the first session of the 18th BRICS Leaders' Meeting in New Delhi and delivered an important speech titled \"Shouldering Our Common Responsibility and Being Pioneers of Our Times.\"",
